      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.39,
      "end_seconds": 7.85,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "Hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.05,
      "end_seconds": 12.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.71,
      "end_seconds": 24.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got a sudden urgent need to go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.63,
      "end_seconds": 28.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.76,
      "end_seconds": 33.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Cranberry juice i take it every day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.31,
      "end_seconds": 36.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.12,
      "end_seconds": 43.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "I'd say two days. Actually, no, closer to ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.11,
      "end_seconds": 66.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Have you had any blood in the urine, new partner or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.18,
      "end_seconds": 71.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "No, no blood in the urine, new partner or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.05,
      "end_seconds": 78.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.04,
      "end_seconds": 81.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.47,
      "end_seconds": 93.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.2,
      "end_seconds": 98.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.63,
      "end_seconds": 103.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.24,
      "end_seconds": 106.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "No, no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.66,
      "end_seconds": 110.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.75,
      "end_seconds": 114.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.1,
      "end_seconds": 117.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.26,
      "end_seconds": 121.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.55,
      "end_seconds": 125.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "So, what's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.32,
      "end_seconds": 131.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.97,
      "end_seconds": 134.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.33,
      "end_seconds": 138.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.37,
      "end_seconds": 150.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.05,
      "end_seconds": 165.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.89,
      "end_seconds": 186.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.78,
      "text": "okay: heart rate 69, temp 36.5 degrees, SpO2 98 percent on room air, blood pressure 124 over 76."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.58,
      "end_seconds": 191.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.09,
      "end_seconds": 194.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.8,
      "end_seconds": 216.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.23,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft with mild tenderness low down and no pain in the loins."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.93,
      "end_seconds": 230.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "sure thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.46,
      "end_seconds": 251.28,
      "duration_seconds": 14.82,
      "text": "okay, that's all I needed to check having listened and examined, it's hard to say a lower urinary tract infection is one possibility and a kidney infection another, and I'd rather not commit yet"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.14,
      "end_seconds": 257.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.46,
      "end_seconds": 285.8,
      "duration_seconds": 27.34,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a lower urinary tract infection do well once it's treated properly i'm going to order a urine test, for dysuria i'm prescribing nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day, for three days you take it by mouth it's for urinary infection drink plenty of water and don't hold on when you need to go"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.34,
      "end_seconds": 298.63,
      "duration_seconds": 11.29,
      "text": "Let's hold off on a urine culture for now, and if there's no change in two weeks we can revisit it. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.56,
      "end_seconds": 302.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.38,
      "end_seconds": 304.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}